{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"atlas-close-e-wu-surrender","title":"孙皓降晋","order":8903,"accounts":[{"id":"atlas-close-a-wu-surrender","label":"三嗣主传","text":"王濬先到，接受孙皓投降，解缚焚榇，延请相见。","evidence":["atlas-close-q-wu-surrender"]},{"id":"atlas-close-a-wu-letter","label":"三嗣主传","text":"孙皓分遣使者，向王濬、司马伷和王浑奉书请降。","evidence":["atlas-close-q-wu-letter"]},{"id":"major-proof-a-wu-letter","label":"薛莹传","text":"孙皓向司马伷、王浑、王濬奉书请降，文书由薛莹撰写。","evidence":["major-proof-q-wu-letter"]},{"id":"santizhu-a-7952939940cd90c76094","label":"正文","text":"孙皓降晋","evidence":["santizhu-q-e4e74308393a35a22bc8"]},{"id":"santizhu-a-b0fc15dc3f07ec88349d","label":"正文","text":"王濬受孙皓降并延请相见","evidence":["santizhu-q-5e1ac8597c6e78a9cfc7"]},{"id":"zhangyan-a-30658308f87af9745c7e","label":"正文","text":"孙皓奉书于司马伷、王浑、王濬请降，其文薛莹所造","evidence":["zhangyan-q-b86fc7f04034d2681027"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0162","role":"投降","evidence":["atlas-close-q-wu-surrender"]},{"person":"luxun-p0077","role":"接受投降","evidence":["atlas-close-q-wu-surrender"]},{"person":"luxun-p0072","role":"撰写请降书","evidence":["major-proof-q-wu-letter"]},{"person":"santizhu-p0125","role":"提出并被采纳的计策","evidence":["santizhu-q-e4e74308393a35a22bc8"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0130","role":"奉书请命的对象，临近吴境","evidence":["santizhu-q-e4e74308393a35a22bc8"]},{"person":"santizhu-p0119","role":"奉书请命的对象，临近吴境","evidence":["santizhu-q-e4e74308393a35a22bc8"]},{"person":"santizhu-p0124","role":"奉使交付印绶请命","evidence":["santizhu-q-e4e74308393a35a22bc8"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":280,"precision":"year","label":"天纪四年三月（正文校记作三月壬寅）","chronology":"atlas-close-y280","evidence":["atlas-close-q-wu-year","atlas-close-q-wu-date","atlas-close-q-wu-surrender"],"dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"atlas-close-q-wu-year","basis":"四年春以下至降晋为同一年连续叙事，现代注释明示天纪四年为公元280。原文日期校记保留，不推算公历日。"}}}],"persons":[{"id":"santizhu-p0124","name":"张夔","evidence":["santizhu-q-e4e74308393a35a22bc8"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"atlas-close-q-wu-date","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-7e623d5c0070fc0c04d7","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗四年：天纪四年（公元 280）。","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":529,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-ce3554cdfa6d4a10d8dc","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"atlas-close-q-wu-letter","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-494ea68636e86f3566e3","layer":"original","quote":"而王濬顺流将至，司马伷、王浑皆临近境。皓用光禄勋薛莹、中书令胡冲等计〖7〗，分遣使，奉书于濬、伷、浑曰：“昔汉室失统，九州分裂；先人因时，略有江南；遂分阻山川，与魏乖隔。今大晋龙兴，德覆四海；暗劣偷安，未喻天命。至于今者，猥烦六军；衡盖路次〖8〗，远临江渚。举国震惶，假息漏刻〖9〗；敢缘天朝，含弘光大。谨遣私署太常张夔等〖10〗，奉所佩印绶，委质请命。惟垂信纳，以济元元〖11〗。”﹝三﹞","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":523,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":195,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"atlas-close-q-wu-surrender","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-c76b27d961ba7e5c15ed","layer":"original","quote":"（壬申）〔三月壬寅〕〖12〗，王濬最先到；于是受皓之降，解缚焚榇〖13〗，延请相见。﹝四﹞","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":524,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":45,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"atlas-close-q-wu-year","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-6d9d569aba82d35ae0c8","layer":"original","quote":"四年春〖1〗，立中山、代等十一王〖2〗。大赦。","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":520,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":23,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"major-proof-q-wu-letter","section":"chapter-053","block":"b-2039c8cd73aadf4de2e9","layer":"original","quote":"天纪四年，晋军征皓；皓奉书于司马伷、王浑、王濬请降：其文，莹所造也。","section_title":"张严程阚薛传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0113.xhtml","index":334,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":44,"end":78,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu-q-5e1ac8597c6e78a9cfc7","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-c76b27d961ba7e5c15ed","layer":"original","quote":"（壬申）〔三月壬寅〕〖12〗，王濬最先到；于是受皓之降，解缚焚榇〖13〗，延请相见","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":524,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":41,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu-q-e4e74308393a35a22bc8","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-494ea68636e86f3566e3","layer":"original","quote":"而王濬顺流将至，司马伷、王浑皆临近境。皓用光禄勋薛莹、中书令胡冲等计〖7〗，分遣使，奉书于濬、伷、浑曰：“昔汉室失统，九州分裂；先人因时，略有江南；遂分阻山川，与魏乖隔。今大晋龙兴，德覆四海；暗劣偷安，未喻天命。至于今者，猥烦六军；衡盖路次〖8〗，远临江渚。举国震惶，假息漏刻〖9〗；敢缘天朝，含弘光大。谨遣私署太常张夔等〖10〗，奉所佩印绶，委质请命","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":523,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":176,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangyan-q-b86fc7f04034d2681027","section":"chapter-053","block":"b-2039c8cd73aadf4de2e9","layer":"original","quote":"皓奉书于司马伷、王浑、王濬请降：其文，莹所造也","section_title":"张严程阚薛传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0113.xhtml","index":334,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":54,"end":77,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
